{"title":"Controller Compatibility","sourceTitle":"Controller Compatibility/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Controller_Compatibility\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Controller Compatibility (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Controller_Compatibility/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Compatibilité manettes (100% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Controller_Compatibility/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Совместимость контроллера (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li></ul></div><p>O jogo base não suporta o uso do controlador, no entanto, existem diferentes programas gratuitos para tornar viável jogar Vintage Story com um controlador.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#DS4Windows\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">DS4Windows</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#AntiMicro\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">AntiMicro</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"DS4Windows\">DS4Windows</span></h2>\n<p>Ele pode ser usado para programar um controle PS4 conectado ao seu computador, possibilitando jogar com o mapeamento de teclas de sua escolha.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"AntiMicro\">AntiMicro</span></h2>\n<p>Ele pode ser usado para programar um controlador Xbox 360/One.\nPara usuários de Windows e Mac, o Antimicro original deve ser usado, para usuários de Linux tanto o Antimicro quanto o Antimicro-X devem funcionar, dependendo do que estiver disponível em seu repositório.\n</p><p>Você pode encontrar uma configuração funcional feita por um usuário discord <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://discordapp.com/channels/302152934249070593/302152934249070593/818313971849232415\">aqui</a>, com as seguintes configurações:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Movimento do stick esquerdo: WASD</li>\n<li>Botão analógico esquerdo: Ctrl</li>\n<li>Movimento do stick direito: mouse</li>\n<li>Botão direito: alterar a velocidade do mouse (rápido/lento)</li>\n<li>RT: Clique esquerdo do mouse</li>\n<li>LT: Clique com o botão direito do mouse</li>\n<li>RB: Rolar o mouse para baixo</li>\n<li>LB: Rolagem do mouse para cima</li>\n<li>R: Espaço</li>\n<li>B: Shift (alternar)</li>\n<li>X:E</li>\n<li>S: C</li>\n<li>Voltar: M</li>\n<li>Início: Esc</li>\n<li>DPad para cima: Q</li>\n<li>DPad para baixo: Ctrl+Q</li>\n<li>DPad Esquerdo: G</li>\n<li>DPad Direita: F</li></ul>\n<p>Nota: ele foi configurado para usar o esquema de controle padrão tanto quanto possível, mas apenas certifique-se de definir \"toggle run\" como verdadeiro.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Navegação Wiki</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>História antiga</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\">Guias</a><span style=\"display:none\">[[::Category:Guides| ]]</span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\">Perguntas frequentes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\">Trilha sonora</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Version_history\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Version history\">Versões</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Version_history\" title=\"Version history\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Controls\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Controls\">Controles</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Controls\" title=\"Controls\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Sistemas de jogo</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Crafting\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Crafting\">Fabricação</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Crafting\" title=\"Crafting\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyL